---
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import ContentSection from '../components/ContentSection.astro';
---
<Page title="Creatives Collective">
  <ContentSection>
    <p>Our Creatives Collective is a regular gathering that brings together a wide variety of Christian practising artists for the purposes of nurture and networking. 
</p>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <p> Bob Thompson, St. Matthew's Description of the End of the World, 1964</p>
    <h2>Each gathering looks a bit different, but in general we share meals, we hear stories about the joys and struggles of the work we do, and we get valuable theological input about the intersection of faith and our creative calling.</h2>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>Interested in joining the Creatives Collective?</h2>
    <p>Get in touch to find out more about joining.</p>
    <ActionLink href="/contact">Ask about the Creatives Collective</ActionLink>
  </ContentSection>
</Page>
